/div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">難い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かたい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">难；困难</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"218390\">これは<ruby>始末<rp>(</rp><rt>しまつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>難<rp>(</rp><rt>かた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>問題<rp>(</rp><rt>もんだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这是一个难以解决的问题。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">片思い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かたおもい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">单恋；单相思</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"204871\">それは<ruby>片思<rp>(</rp><rt>かたおも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いの<ruby>恋<rp>(</rp><rt>こい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这是一个片面的爱情。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">敵</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かたき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">对手；敌手；竞争者；仇敌；复仇；报仇；配偶；伴侣</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">気質</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かたぎ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v