lass=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">固める</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かためる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">硬化；冻结；加强；凝固；握拳；夯实；汇集；收集；聚合；整合；稳固；稳定；坚定（信念、决心等）；确立（证据）；加固；强化；支撑；为特定目的穿戴（盔甲、外套等）；发誓；坚决立誓；郑重承诺；紧紧束缚；系紧；固定；满弓；持满弓状态</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"143123\"><ruby>政府<rp>(</rp><rt>せいふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はテロ<ruby>撲滅<rp>(</rp><rt>ぼくめつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>決意<rp>(</rp><rt>けつい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>固<rp>(</rp><rt>かた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">政府决心结束恐怖主义。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">偏る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かたよる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">倾斜；倾向一侧；不均衡；偏重；集中；偏心；有偏见；带有成见</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"197745\">ハンバーガーばかり<ruby>食<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>べていると、<ruby>栄養<rp>(</rp><rt>えいよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>偏<rp>(</rp><rt>かたよ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>るよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">如果你只吃汉堡,你的饮食会很不平衡</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">傍ら</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かたわら</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">旁边；边；侧面；附近；同时；一边……一边……；除……之外</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">課題</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かだい</spa